    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307980</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、いて……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, ow...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308044</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>トドメっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll finish you...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308160</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わー！！　待って待って待って、
タイム！　ストーップ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Waaah! Wait, wait, wait!
Time out! Stooooooop!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308328</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>冗談！　ジョークだってば！
も～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It was just a joke!
You know, "haha,"
for a laugh! Jeez...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308440</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>街荒らしたり、
魔術暴走させたりして、
ジョークですむかよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You've wrecked a town, sent that
magic out of control, and now
you wanna say it's all a joke!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308660</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>待ってよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308660</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_020&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そりゃ、イタズラしてたけど、
そーんなひどいこと
してないつもりだよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, so, like, I've played some
pranks, but, like, I didn't really
do anything *that* bad, I think?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308660</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_021&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それに、
その魔術の暴走なんて
知らないよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And I don't know anything
about magic going
out of control, or whatever!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308768</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_022&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、
ブライトローズさんの
しわざじゃないんですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, those things
weren't the work
of Bright Rose?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308892</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>明るい薔薇色（ブライトローズ）？
あたしの名前は
&lt;Arche&gt;・クライン</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Bright Rose...?
My name is
&lt;Arche&gt; Klaine.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308964</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Arche&gt;……って……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"&lt;Arche&gt;"... Uhh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309072</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>えーっ！　もしかして……
ダオスを倒したっていう……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huuhhh!? Wait, you don't mean,
the one who defeated Dhaos...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309176</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうそう……あれ？
あたしってば、
けっこう有名人？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right, right... Wait,
huh? Am I, like,
actually pretty famous?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309240</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_027&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>えっと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ummm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309300</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_028&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>誰……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Who...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309408</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_029&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>５０年前、魔王ダオスを
倒した英雄、時空戦士の
ひとりだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>One of the Heroes of Time,
who defeated the Demon
King Dhaos fifty years ago.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309508</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_030&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>５０年前？
でも、そんな歳には
見えないけど……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Fifty years ago?
But, she doesn't
look that old...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309608</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_031&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あたし、これでもいちおー、
ハーフエルフだかんね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I know I might not seem too
special, but I *am* a half-elf, sooo!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309708</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_032&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>エルフの一族の寿命が長いって
マジだったんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh. So that stuff about
the elves being "very
long-lived" was true...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309820</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_033&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>その、&lt;Arche&gt;さんは
&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ&lt;White&gt;のこと、
知らないんですね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, um... &lt;Arche&gt;. You don't
know anything about what
happened in &lt;Red&gt;Valhalla&lt;White&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309912</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_034&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>最近、&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ&lt;White&gt;には
行ってないしね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I haven't been to
&lt;Red&gt;Valhalla&lt;White&gt; in a while, so.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310012</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_035&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、あれはやっぱり、
わたしの魔術のせい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, that must have
been because of *my*
magic, after all...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310076</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_036&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310152</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_037&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ん？　ん？　どったの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm? Hm? Wassup?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310244</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_038&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……やっぱ四大精霊
探すっきゃねーな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...So we'll have to look
for the Four Great
Spirits after all, huh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310940</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_047&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>最近じゃみんな、
人目のないところに
隠れ住んでるって言うからね～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, lately, they've allll been
living in hiding, so humans
won't find them, y'know~?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310668</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_044&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どっ、どこに！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-Where!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310760</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_045&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>さあ。それはあたしには
わっかりませーん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dunno. They didn't
tell me where they
went, either~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311048</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_048&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ま、でも餅は餅屋って言うしぃ、
&lt;Klarth&gt;に聞いてくれば？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, well, if you want a ring,
you'd ask a jeweler, right? So...
Why don't you go ask &lt;Klarth&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311152</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_049&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Klarth&gt;？　それって……
&lt;Klarth&gt;・Ｆ・レスター博士？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Klarth&gt;? You mean...
Prof. &lt;Klarth&gt; F. Lester?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_050&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あはは、博士だって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahaha, "professor," ehe...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311424</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_052&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ってことは、じゃあ
レスター博士も、
どっかで生きてんのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...So wait, then, uh...
Is Prof. Lester still
alive somewhere, too?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311512</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_053&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ん～。半分アタリで
半分はずれ、かな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmmm... Well, you're like, half
right, but half wrong, I guess?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311580</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_054&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……はい、コレ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Here, take this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311716</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_055&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この絵に強く念じると、
なんと！　２００年前の世界と
カンタンに行き来できちゃうのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you focus aaalll your wishes on this
painting, then, wow! Just like that, you
can zoom back, 200 years into the past.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311780</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_056&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この絵で？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This painting can do that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311840</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_057&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まさか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No way...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312104</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_058&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>嘘だと思ったら、
試してみればいいじゃん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you don't believe
me, why don't you
just give it a try?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312104</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_059&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、お家に持って帰って
やってね。あと、それと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, so that, you can
just take back to your
house. And also, um...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312104</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_060&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>さらさらっと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>*rustle*...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312104</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_061&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はい、君たちの似顔絵、
こっちの時代に戻ってくる用</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here's a portrait of you
two, that you can use
to return to this time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312440</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_065&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうそう、&lt;Klarth&gt;は、
&lt;Red&gt;ユークリッド&lt;White&gt;って村に
いるからね～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh and, right, &lt;Klarth&gt;
lives in a village called
&lt;Red&gt;Euclid&lt;White&gt;, just so you know~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312196</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_062&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとう……ございます。
&lt;Arche&gt;さん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you...so
much, &lt;Arche&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312264</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_063&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、サ、サンキュ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, yeah... Th-Thanks...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312328</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_064&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんのなんの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nope, nothin' to it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312500</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_066&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312576</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_067&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>こんな感じでよかった？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Was that okay?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312656</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_068&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとうございます、&lt;Arche&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you very much, &lt;Arche&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312752</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_069&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どういたしまして。
でもさ、なんなの、これ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're welcome.
But, what's all
this about, anyway?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312848</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_070&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それはいずれわかるでしょう。
今はこれで……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You will find out,
someday. For now,
I take my leave...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312932</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_071&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え……？
あ、あれ、ちょっと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh...? Ah,
um, wait...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>312992</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_060_072&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もお……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Jeez...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
